			"versionNonce": 407931047,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1783444463769,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "1. Start at the first element (index 0).\n2. Compare the current element with the search key.\n3. If it matches, return the index.\n   If it doesn't match, move to the next element.\n4. If the end of the collection is reached without a match, return -1.\nNote on Ordered Collections: If the collection is sorted, you can optimize slightly by stopping early if you pass\nthe point where the element would logically be",
			"rawText": "1. Start at the first element (index 0).\n2. Compare the current element with the search key.\n3. If it matches, return the index.\n   If it doesn't match, move to the next element.\n4. If the end of the collection is reached without a match, return -1.\nNote on Ordered Collections: If the collection is sorted, you can optimize slightly by stopping early if you pass the point where the element would logically be",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "A7txoHta",
			"originalText": "1. Start at the first element (index 0).\n2. Compare the current element with the search key.\n3. If it matches, return the index.\n   If it doesn't match, move to the next element.\n4. If the end of the collection is reached without a match, return -1.\nNote on Ordered Collections: If the collection is sorted, you can optimize slightly by stopping early if you pass the point where the element would logically be",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
